, une lame recourbée et son manche. Le Shuowen jiezi le range parmi les armes. En bas de 分, il coupe en deux ce que sépare 八, et à droite d'un caractère il se dresse en 刂.","en":"On oracle bones, 刀 draws a knife, a curved blade and its handle. The Shuowen jiezi counts it among weapons. At the bottom of 分 it cuts in two what 八 divides, and on the right of a character it stands up as 刂.","roles":{}}},"叨":{"c":"叨","pinyin":"dāo","lectures":["dāo","dáo","tāo"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2531","L7-4702"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"radoter ; bénéficier de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"radoter, rabâcher (en composé)"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"bénéficier de (formule polie)","pinyin":"tāo"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"妈妈又在唠叨了。","pinyin":"Māma yòu zài láodao le.","fr":"Maman recommence à ronchonner.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"导":{"c":"导","pinyin":"dǎo","lectures":["dǎo"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["巳","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0142","L3-0457","L3-0918","L4-0166","L4-0167","L4-0882","L5-0098","L5-0830","L5-1034","L7-0769","L7-0770","L7-0771","L7-0772","L7-0773","L7-1200","L7-3812","L7-4409"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"guider, conduire","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"guider, conduire, diriger"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"岛":{"c":"岛","pinyin":"dǎo","lectures":["dǎo"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⿱丿⿴#(-𠃌㇉)丶","山"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0205","L7-0072","L7-0774"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"île","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"île"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这个岛上没有人住。","pinyin":"Zhège dǎo shang méiyǒu rén zhù.","fr":"Personne n'habite sur cette île.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"捣":{"c":"捣","pinyin":"dǎo","lectures":["dǎo"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","⿱丿⿴#(-𠃌㇉)丶","山"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","s