:"Je voudrais boire un peu d'eau.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"La forme traditionnelle, 點, est pour le Shuowen jiezi un idéo-phonétique glosé « petite tache noire ». 黑, le noir, en donne le sens, et 占, fait de ⺊ et de 口, en donnait le son, que sa lecture actuelle, zhàn, ne fait plus entendre. La simplification n'a gardé de 黑 que les quatre points du bas, 灬, posés sous 占.","en":"The traditional form, 點, is for the Shuowen jiezi a phonetic compound glossed as “a small black spot”. 黑, black, gives the meaning, and 占, made of ⺊ and 口, gave the sound, which its modern reading, zhàn, no longer carries. The simplified form kept only the four dots at the bottom of 黑, 灬, set beneath 占.","roles":{"⺊":"forme","口":"forme","灬":"sens"}}},"垫":{"c":"垫","pinyin":"diàn","lectures":["diàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","丸","土"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0861","L7-0862","L7-0863"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"caler ; avancer de l'argent ; coussin","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"caler, mettre dessous"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"avancer de l'argent"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"coussin, tapis"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我先帮你垫上饭钱。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiān bāng nǐ diàn shang fàn qián.","fr":"Je t'avance l'argent du repas.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"奠":{"c":"奠","pinyin":"diàn","lectures":["diàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["丷","酉","大"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0866","L7-1926"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"fonder ; offrir en sacrifice","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"fonder, établir"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"offrir en sacrifice aux morts"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"店":{"c":"店","pinyin":"diàn","lectures":["diàn"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["广","⺊","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0100","L1-0314","L1-0343","L2-0128","L2-0302","L2-0640","L6-0563","L7-0193","L7-2602","L7-5482"],"chemin":{"hsk":135,"lire":177},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"boutique, magasin, auberge","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这家店的包子很好吃。","pinyin":"Zhè jiā diàn de bāozi hěn hǎochī.","fr":"Les baozi de cette boutique sont délicieux.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"店 est un caractère tardif, absent du Shuowen jiezi. Pour s'en souvenir : sous 广, un toit ouvert d'un côté comme un auvent, se tient une échoppe. En bas, 占, fait de ⺊ et de 口, se lit zhàn ; on le retrouve dans 点, diǎn, qui sonne presque comme diàn.","en":"店 is a late character, not found in the Shuowen jiezi. To remember it: under 广, a roof open on one side like an awning, stands a stall. Below, 占, made of ⺊ and 口, reads zhàn; it also appears in 点, diǎn, which sounds almost like diàn.","roles":{"广":"sens","⺊":"forme","口":"forme"}}},"惦":{"c":"惦","pinyin":"diàn","lectures":["diàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["忄","广","⺊","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0865"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"penser à, se soucier de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"penser à, se soucier de"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"殿":{"c":"殿","pinyin":"diàn","lectures":["diàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["尸","龷","八","殳"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0867","L7-1382"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"palais, salle de temple","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"palais, salle de temple"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null}}}
